# DRY-lint exemption registry — for APPLIED (frozen) migrations only.
#
# Applied migrations must not be edited in place (supabase/migrations/
# CLAUDE.md), so the in-file `-- DRY exemption:` channel is unavailable
# retroactively. Acknowledge frozen-file columns here as
# `<migration basename>:<column>` with the reason alongside.
#
# rate_schedules.award_code — FWC award identifier sourced from the Fair Work
# API at schedule-build time; no canonical local awards row exists to FK for
# EA/custom schedules, and the code is frozen into the schedule snapshot.
20260706180000_create_rate_schedules.sql:award_code
#
# boot_assessments.award_code — BOOT assessments freeze the FWC award code the
# assessment was evaluated against (immutable audit snapshot; award data is
# API-sourced, no local awards row to FK).
20260704060000_boot_assessments_rederive.sql:award_code
